{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are twenty-four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers that use each of the four digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> exactly once.  Listed in numerical order from smallest to largest, the number in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa8d60c8d9a160065f0e6404cbb272473e703c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> position in the list is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb7f81179ecb98746770cee346f6d0b3f32ad60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4527 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 5724 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5742 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7245 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 7524$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each digit appears as the thousands digit in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3920c5e3f6b2e5749cd75c3853b63ae714d00561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> numbers. Therefore, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/7/577852492c760c735842af03d20abcacb69c56e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3eca551f05259d042baeea07628877a31013c6a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> numbers start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and thus the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa8d60c8d9a160065f0e6404cbb272473e703c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> number on the list is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2c6aee472eb54f9e0b0956748c7ca7bbcfdb70a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> number starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  The numbers starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from smallest to largest, are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/3941d147c7228c0ebe5346aec867b7edddeec51e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5247,5274,5427,5472,5724,5742$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"260\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd859ab24747e2be624b260e4daa03fafcf47047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5724}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"83\" height=\"30\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa8d60c8d9a160065f0e6404cbb272473e703c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> on the list.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Proble